[^rb]: Restaurant Business, *Sweetgreen wanted to reach 1,000 units by the end of the decade. It may take a bit longer*, 2026. <https://www.restaurantbusinessonline.com/operations/sweetgreen-wanted-reach-1000-units-end-decade-it-may-take-bit-longer>
